{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Another Game About Clicking</strong>, where every click brings you closer to a colorful collection of adorable\u2026 and sometimes fearsome, companions! Dive into a minimalist universe filled with creatures ranging from the adorable squirrel to the formidable bear, all ready to join you on your clicker and idle adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Addictive click mechanics:</strong> every click counts, every upgrade matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Idle mode:</strong> your production continues even when you\u2019re not playing; come back later to collect your rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pet collection:</strong> gather companions from the explorer squirrel to the giant bear\u2014the first clicker game that\u2019s also undeniably cute.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade system:</strong> spend your coins to boost your production and cut down wait times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Prestige with Golden Eggs:</strong> reset your progress to earn Golden Eggs and gain permanent multipliers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fishing minigame:</strong> yes, you read that right\u2014the first clicker with a fishing minigame.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Achievements:</strong> will you reach your first quintillion? Unlock them all.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650320?t=1745344715","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650320?t=1745344715","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650320/d07b99f1a039d353de892c21cf44b6d5cb6e4701/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745344715","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_